  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tbillington/kondo/tarball/v0.9",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tbillington/kondo/zipball/v0.9",
  "body": "This is the 0.9 release, finally 😅 \r\n\r\nIt adds support for 5 new project types (up to 24 total), dry runs, and a \"single key\" mode to make using the cli even speedier!\r\n\r\nAs always, thank you to all the new and existing contributors for their efforts <3\r\n\r\n## Added\r\n* Add Pixi support by @gzsombor in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/119\r\n* add: turborepo support by @alimehasin in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/125\r\n* feat: add `dry-run` option by @Rodrigodd in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/133\r\n* Support Haskell cabal projects by @SanchayanMaity in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/143\r\n* feat: add support for react-native projects (closes #148) by @mgcrea in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/173\r\n* feat: add support for terraform by @WookiesRpeople2 in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/170\r\n* Add a \"single key\" mode by @cstyles in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/163\r\n\r\n\r\n## Improvements\r\n* Fix: Add .zig-cache and zig-out dirs to zig project by @Tomcat-42 in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/147\r\n* Update README.md with winget install command by @licon4812 in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/116\r\n* added windows GUI install to readme by @licon4812 in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/129\r\n* readme: add MacPorts install info by @herbygillot in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/130\r\n* chore(ci): build with `--locked` flag by @orhun in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/115\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @licon4812 made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/116\r\n* @alimehasin made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/125\r\n* @herbygillot made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/130\r\n* @Rodrigodd made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/133\r\n* @SanchayanMaity made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/143\r\n* @Tomcat-42 made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/147\r\n* @jarjk made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/172\r\n* @mgcrea made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/173\r\n* @WookiesRpeople2 made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/170\r\n* @cstyles made their first contribution in https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/pull/163\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tbillington/kondo/compare/v0.8...v0.9",
